# The build context of ingest/Dockerfile and of webapp/Dockerfile is the
# repository root. This one file serves both images: Railway support for a
# separate ignore file next to each Dockerfile is not verified. This file
# is an allowlist: it excludes everything, and then includes only the
# inputs that the COPY lines of the two Dockerfiles name. So no .env file,
# secrets/, .bin/, .git, target/, node_modules/, or dist/ directory reaches
# a builder. Each image reads only its own inputs: the COPY lines, not this
# file, keep the sources of the web image out of the ingest image, and the
# reverse (crates/ingest/tests/deployment.rs and
# crates/server/tests/deployment.rs check both).
*
# Both images: the Cargo workspace.
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!.cargo/config.toml
!crates/*/Cargo.toml
# The ingest image.
!crates/ingest/
!db/
!migrations/
!ingest/
# The web image.
!crates/server/
!crates/domain/
!webapp/
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/
!web/
# Exclude these again inside the included directories.
**/.env*
**/secrets
**/.bin
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
